                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "For anyone somehow stumbling upon this game in year of our lord 2023, this game is absolutely not worth purchasing. I'm not sure what happened to this game, not only does this game seem abandoned (as the last update from the dev was 2 years ago) but a lot of stuff i remember being in the game just isn't there anymore. \n\nI remember the beginnings of what was gonna be the single player campaign being in the game but there seems to be no way to access that content anymore if it's even in the game at this point.\n\nAnd as for the multiplayer, of course this game has absolutely no active players but even the \"multiplayer\" (playing the multiplayer modes by yourself with bots) doesn't work even though i remember that being a working feature before. Like it's even advertised in the about section as a feature. But most baffling of all is that the guns don't actually shoot anything? \n\nI might be doing something wrong that's borking the \"multiplayer\" from working but if its an actual consistent problem it means this game has no content anymore beyond just running around empty maps and navigating menus.",
